# 4×1 Multiplexer (MUX)

## Overview

This project implements a **4×1 Multiplexer** in Verilog HDL using three different modeling styles:

- Behavioral Modeling
- Gate-Level Modeling
- Structural Modeling

---

## Truth Table

| S1 | S0 | Output |
|----|----|--------|
| 0  | 0  | a |
| 0  | 1  | b |
| 1  | 0  | c |
| 1  | 1  | d |

---

## Project Files

| File | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `Mux_4_Behav.v` | Behavioral implementation |
| `Mux_4_GL.v` | Gate-Level implementation |
| `Mux_2.v` | 2×1 Multiplexer used in Structural design |
| `Mux_4_Structural.v` | Structural implementation |

